Package: ootail
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Capability-bounded file tail and follower utility
 A drop-in tail replacement written in pure openOODA, featuring
 line windowing (-n), inotify-probed following (-f), truncated file
 recovery, and zero ambient authority capability security.
